//
// TO ADD A POST: copy a block below. `date` is YYYY-MM-DD; newest first is
// handled automatically. `photo` is optional — put the image in
// public/media/ (or public/images/guru-purnima/) and reference it here.
// `url` is optional too; without it the post shows as text only.
//
// The registration page for the 2026 event lives at /guru-purnima/register/.
// It is kept online for anyone holding an old link, but is not in the nav.

